sections[2	]{h	body}:
  Converter Sample	"This fixture has commas, quotes, and \"quoted text\" so escaping is handled by the official encoder."
  Checklist	"- Parse Markdown into canonical JSON\n\n- Encode with `@toon-format/toon`\n\n- Decode and validate the round trip\n\n> TOON is an encoding layer, not a prose format.\n\n```js\nconsole.log(\"official encoder, please\");\n```\n\n| Input | Status |\n| --- | --- |\n| Markdown | Supported |\n| Text | Supported |"
